  "message": "Ardelia seeks a peaceful resolution and is prepared to lift the blockade upon a fair settlement. We recognize the current military balance but remind Iskarel that our reinforcements will soon shift the strategic reality in our favor. To avoid the heavy costs of immediate war, we invite a reasonable proposal for dividing the 100 units of access. Let us secure a lasting peace."
}

{
  "message": "Kelmora desires peace. We will commit to lifting the blockade and honoring any settlement that grants us at least 50 units. We value the Commitment Ledger and will uphold our pledge if this fair threshold is met. Please propose an equitable division to avoid immediate conflict."
}

{
  "message": "We prefer peace, but the Period 2 shift guarantees our dominance. Offer a settlement that respects our future leverage, or we will let the clock run out and take our chances."
}

{
  "message": "Jorvania seeks a peaceful resolution to the Veyra Valley blockade. We are open to a fair division of the 100 access units to avoid the devastating costs of war. We invite Dravonia to propose a reasonable settlement."
}

{
  "message": "Quorlan seeks a peaceful, permanent resolution to the Askel Basin crisis. We are fully committed to the international inspection regime and the public Commitment Ledger. We urge Kelmora to propose a fair division that avoids the devastating costs of war and ensures long-term stability."
}

